{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"attributed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE15AttributedStyleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AttributedStyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/AttributedStyle"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle","type":"reference"},{"text":" instance to customize the lexical","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"representation of a date as a string. Use the format style’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"attributed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property to customize the visual representation of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"date as a string. Attributed strings can represent the subcomponent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"characters, words, and phrases of a string with a custom combination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of font size, weight, and color."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, the function below uses a date format style to create a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"custom lexical representation of a date, then retrieves an attributed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"string representation of the same date and applies a visual emphasis","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the year component of the date.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["private func makeAttributedString() -> AttributedString {","    let date = Date()","    let formatStyle = Date.FormatStyle(date: .abbreviated, time: .standard)","    var attributedString = formatStyle.attributed.format(date)","    for run in attributedString.runs {","        if let dateFieldAttribute = run.attributes.foundation.dateField,","           dateFieldAttribute == .year {","            attributedString[run.range].inlinePresentationIntent = [.emphasized, .stronglyEmphasized]","        }","    }","    return attributedString","}"]}]}],"deprecationSummary":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use attributedStyle instead"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationinternationalization\/foundationessentials\/date\/formatstyle\/attributed-swift.property"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle\/attributed-swift.property"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"FoundationInternationalization"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"attributed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE15AttributedStyleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AttributedStyle"}],"platforms":[{"beta":false,"deprecatedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","name":"iOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecatedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","name":"iPadOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecatedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"beta":false,"deprecatedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"12.0","unavailable":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","name":"macOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecatedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","name":"tvOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecatedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"message":"Use attributedStyle instead","name":"watchOS"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"attributed","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV10attributedAcDE010AttributedF0Vvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/AttributedStyle"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Deprecated","title":"Deprecated"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type-erased attributed variant of this style."}],"references":{"doc://FoundationInternationalization/documentation/FoundationInternationalization/FoundationEssentials/Date/FormatStyle":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":